From: shezw <hello@shezw.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 17:05:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] WPE 2.52.5: resolve libseccomp in WebKit scope

JingWei
tools/wpe/patches wpewebkit-2.52.5-libseccomp-scoped-link.patch    2026-07-18

The cache entry exists after configuration but is not populated when the WPE
platform target list is evaluated. Resolve libseccomp in the WPE platform
scope so a post-target patch can link the absolute path.

@link: https://github.com/shezw/JingWei
@author: shezw
@email: hello@shezw.com
---
 Source/WebKit/PlatformWPE.cmake | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Source/WebKit/PlatformWPE.cmake b/Source/WebKit/PlatformWPE.cmake
--- a/Source/WebKit/PlatformWPE.cmake
+++ b/Source/WebKit/PlatformWPE.cmake
@@ -514 +514 @@
-    list(APPEND WebKit_LIBRARIES Libseccomp::Libseccomp)
+    find_library(JINGWEI_LIBSECCOMP_LIBRARY NAMES seccomp REQUIRED)
--
2.43.0
